WEBVTT

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.620
Beetles will be here too by summer.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.080
Beetles?

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:07.250
You don't know what they are?

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:08.910
I do.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.220
But I've never seen one.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.890
<i>Hi, it's Jennifer!</i>

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.220
<i>Well, what can I say about last time...</i>

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.560
<i>It was like watching a comedy between two unbelievably dense characters.</i>

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.520
<i>Geez... Someone tell me something!!</i>

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:30.030
<i>Oh? I get a part in this episode?</i>

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.820
<i>Okay, okay. I guess I can do something about it then.</i>

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.900
<i>What? Not until the second half?</i>

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.450
<i>Fine, I'll just have a drink while I wait.</i>

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.740
<i>Yes, let's get this started already!</i>

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:46.660
Whisper goodbye to the unsightly world,.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:53.410
and embellish its entirety with those crimson wings.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:06.580
The filthier this world becomes,.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:10.760
the dearer its living things are.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:18.290
The more I hate it, the stronger my desire to embrace it.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:24.950
Staring intently at a mirror reveals my dark side.

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:30.670
People hide their weaknesses,.

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:37.870
by hurting those who are kind.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:44.810
Whisper goodbye to the unsightly world,.

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:50.330
and dance around it gloriously with those crimon wings.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.880
Please kiss me passionately,.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.660
as often as you want,.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:02.850
if you notice my heart raging violently.

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:09.370
So I might change once more.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:49.480
Geez... Why can't he just tell me if he's going to be late?

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.940
It's always like that...

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.360
Stupid brother!

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:58.200
Ah, he's home.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.740
Geez, where were you?

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.330
Oh Kimi, I'm home.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.940
Girls always went after him but he never seemed to notice!

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:35.780
I was so sure he had no interest in girls!

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:40.660
Even if he's spaced out for most of the day, those pent-up urges must've been growing daily!

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:45.320
Taking care of an older brother is too much for a grade-schooler to do alone after all...

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:48.820
What to do, what to do!? There's no going back!

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.110
Kimi, is dinner ready?

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:54.830
Don't show your dumb face when your little sister is facing an emotional crisis, stupid brother!

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:16.600
Well, from what I understand, your name is Akari and you're a homeless person living in the woods.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:19.180
Not like that, Akari is more...

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.690
Tha's it, more like a special girl.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.980
What? She seems normal enough to me.

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:25.900
This is good...

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:30.360
Hey you, do you realize how abnormal the life you lead is?

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:31.320
More, please!

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:33.200
Just how many do you think you've eaten already?

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:38.450
Now I get it!

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:39.800
Eh, get what?

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.790
Akari likes delicious things, right?

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:44.320
Yes, I like them.

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:47.830
I think I'm going to collapse...

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.670
Okay, guys need to get out, out, out.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:03.800
At least wear some panties...

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.470
You sure are filthy.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:12.690
When was the last time you took a bath?

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:14.020
I don't know.

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:15.730
You don't know?

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:19.780
You actually have a home to go back to, don't you?

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.280
I don't know.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.240
Probably not.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.660
What about your mother and father?

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:27.240
I don't know.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:28.950
Really?

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:29.950
Yup.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:35.880
I see... Okay, I won't ask anymore.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.960
In return, you have to let me do this thoroughly!

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.170
Hey, are you done yet?

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:44.750
And of course, with the best timing you come in and... peek!

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:48.590
I've gotten used to seeing naked girls from looking at you, Kimi.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.590
Wh-What are you talking about, stupid brother!

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:56.970
Hey, it's been over a year since I last took a bath with my brother, okay?

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.030
I wonder if it'll be sunny tomorrow.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.280
Why that all of a sudden?

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:21.290
The weather forecast said it'll be cloudy for a week.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:24.000
Don't worry, it'll clear up tomorrow.

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:27.670
Without anything to back it up... what are you talking about?

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:35.720
I'm sure of it.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:42.640
Since there's no other choice, I'll sleep with her tonight.

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:45.390
You can sleep in my room, okay?

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:47.940
I want to sleep with Ryou.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:50.150
Please don't say anything that'll cause problems.

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:52.280
Don't worry, Akari.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:55.360
Kimi is quite huggable. I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.950
H-H-Hey! What the heck are you saying?

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:00.740
Don't say anything misleading, stupid brother!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.910
You're the one making it misleading.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.460
Well, good night.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:08.920
G-Good night.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:12.590
Good... night.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.890
Wh-What?

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:27.480
No fair, Kimi. You slept with Ryou too...

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:32.190
I might not look it, but I have nights where it's hard to sleep alone too.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:35.190
In any case, it's fine for me to sleep with my brother.

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:38.700
We're family, so... sleeping together is normal.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.540
Family... is nice.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:05.850
H-Hey, what are you doing?

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:09.940
He's right. You feel kinda good.

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:16.820
Don't you think my house is weird?

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.280
There's no mother or father.

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:20.700
I don't know.

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:26.280
I won't bore you with the details so I'll keep it short.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.110
They both died.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:34.330
When I say that to people, they look at us like we're the image of unhappiness.

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:37.410
Those kind of things just made it all the more unbearable.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:43.040
"Poor thing, poor thing." It's like people can't help but pity us.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:48.470
If you ask me, what's really pitiful is your lack of creativity!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.470
But you have Ryou, right?

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.810
Even two makes a family, right?

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.520
Family is nice.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:00.700
Yeah.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.690
N-No, what are you doing?

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.470
O-Ow, ow, ow, ow! What was that?

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:23.620
What's the matter?

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:26.130
Bug... bug... bug!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.340
Hey, look. A beetle!

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.300
It actually followed me.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.890
He must really like you, Akari.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.260
Yeah!

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.230
It looks miserable.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:46.610
I-I won't have it running loose.

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:48.530
Geez, that scared me.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.190
Why's it here this season anyway?

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:54.700
Never mind that, let's just go to bed.

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:58.160
Good night.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.870
Kimi, are you mad?

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.550
It's okay. I said some strange things before too.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:10.880
Strange?

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:15.800
It's not like I pity you more than myself or anything, okay?

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.870
I just thought we might be alike.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:22.770
Yup, okay. I forgive you.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.570
And I have a family too.

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:33.570
Kuon, and the beetle.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.610
That's why I'm not lonely.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:39.240
Putting aside... the beetle for now...

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.200
What is Kuon?

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.450
I don't know.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.080
That again...

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.540
Oh well, that's fine.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.330
Kimi?

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:54.340
Let me hug you too.

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:32.250
Thanks to a good night's sleep, your fever's nearly gone.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:33.840
Yup, more please!

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.260
Your appetite seems better, too.

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:37.840
Yup, more please!

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.260
So please leave after this one.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:42.010
Yup, more please!

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:53.150
Huh?

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:55.200
Please don't take this personally.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.160
We have no choice.

00:11:57.160 --> 00:12:01.450
The only source of income we have is our parents' inheritance and my brother's part-time job.

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:04.910
We can't spare enough to raise a growing child.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:06.960
Really?

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:07.830
Yes, really!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.960
So... why'd you end up coming here?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:19.130
My brother said there's a house here that takes in girls with mysterious backgrounds.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.340
That sounds pretty bad...

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:24.460
And this time, there's this weird thing with her, too.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.330
It looks cute but not really...

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:29.000
What is this?

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.420
Please don't ask me.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:38.140
And so I've been thinking that Hikari and Akari might have something in common.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:42.180
Ah, I see. They're both from those woods...

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.400
Ah, don't say it!

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.740
Yes, this can only mean one thing!

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:59.120
If it happened twice, it'll happen three times!

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.080
And no more than three times!

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.800
Okay, let's go...

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:03.800
- Hikari, Akari, or whoever...

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:05.970
What's with those guys?

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.330
Ignore them.

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:19.430
Suprisingly, nothing happened...

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:21.300
Don't you two know each other?

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:23.310
No, not at all.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:24.810
Nice to meet you.

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:30.360
But you were traveling in space till now and you both ended up on Earth...

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:32.940
You guys have the same memories, right?

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:37.780
I think so, I kind of remember up until then but...

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:40.320
I've forgotten everything until just now.

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:47.040
Isn't it possible that they used to be one being?

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:51.090
Of course, that's just a theory.

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:53.340
She's daring.

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:55.800
Don't you have any common sense?

00:13:56.920 --> 00:14:01.720
You know, you can't form a theory using common sense.

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:03.680
You need to go after it more boldly.

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.020
Like this, for example...

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.560
H-Hey...!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.650
How nice.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:13.900
I told you to put some clothes on before showing yourself in front of people!

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:14.980
I was just kidding.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:16.900
Is this place always like this?

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:20.200
I heard this interesting conversation while I was heading down the hallway to go wash my face.

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:20.200
Hm... as of late in particular?

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:29.000
You see, if you girls were travelling in space together, you would've at least met.

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:32.290
It began as one mysterious spirit.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:39.260
It came to Earth for some reason and split in two for some reason. Wouldn't that be the simplest explanation?

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.010
Spirit?

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:43.680
It doesn't matter what you call it.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:47.540
For creatures made up of physical matter,.

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.330
space is just too vast.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:57.710
In other words, they need an infinite amount of time to traverse it. A body of flesh and blood just won't last.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:02.720
So you're saying they only took on these forms <i>after</i> reaching Earth?

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:08.480
Well, that's only if the two of them are telling the whole truth.

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.980
To make a long story short...

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:17.110
...you're saying that Akari and I are like sisters, right?

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:19.570
Really?

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:22.070
Is that... so?

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:24.160
Isn't that great, Akari?

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:25.580
Yeah!

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.290
I'm suprised too.

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:32.120
So, in the end, we're not really sure of anything.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:37.710
Even so, theorizing begins with irresponsible ideas.

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:42.680
What comes from that is a much more flexible hypothesis than the stereotypical ones.

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:49.470
Biologically, they definitely look like normal adolescent human girls.

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:54.690
It'd be harder to believe that they were in space looking like that.

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:56.310
I guess so.

00:15:56.690 --> 00:16:01.740
It's not even funny for an alien to be born with a better figure than me...

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:05.070
If we think of it this way, we might be able to keep our pride.

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:14.080
Yes, I accept the Jennifer Theory!

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.460
Seconded!

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:17.040
We're not asking that!

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:24.680
Besides, even if that's true, why are they here? Why human girls and not frogs or fish?

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:29.140
Beats me. I might come up with something if I go to sleep drunk tonight.

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.800
I like fish.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:33.230
Because they're tasty!

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:36.400
What a coincidence. Me too!

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:40.360
It's starting to seem more and more like we're sisters.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.700
Well isn't that wonderful...

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:47.490
Big sister, that person is scary.

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:50.760
Don't worry, she's not as bad as she looks.

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:54.620
Well, well. Now that it's settled for the time being...

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:56.790
...let's do the one from before again!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.260
What kind of clothes should we make this time?

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:12.150
Wow, Akari is so comfortable with intimacy!

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.400
Eh, um...

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:16.680
Why don't we try something a bit brighter this time?

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.400
Isn't that great?

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:21.190
Well then, we can now go home without worries.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:22.440
Take care.

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:25.360
Come on, let's go!

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:28.460
Wait, Akari!

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:38.580
No! If I have to live with someone, it has to be Ryou!

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:39.580
That's what I've decided!

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:42.090
D-Don't decide that on your own!

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:43.840
I don't mind.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:44.890
Brother!

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:48.510
And you're at Ryou's house too, right?

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:06.990
If it's family... If you're going to be part of our family, I might approve of that.

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:15.160
So hurry up and put some clothes on.

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:16.290
Come on.

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:17.290
Okay.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.790
I guess it's settled.

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.540
We didn't get to dress her up.

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:24.590
Seems pretty rough at your place too.

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:25.710
Eh, how so?

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:27.800
That's Ryou-sama all right!

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:31.090
Much more open-minded than some guy who looks like he just got out of bed all the time.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:32.680
Sleeping has nothing to do with it!

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:42.400
Approximately 13 years old.

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:47.240
Thanks for having us!

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:04.460
Mari, could you come give me a hand?

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:06.030
Okay!

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:09.260
Hikari, let's go back inside.

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:10.750
Okay.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:18.310
Hikari...

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:35.580
Come on, let's get back inside.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.580
You'll catch a cold out here.

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:41.210
Hey there! That's not the place for that, young man!

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:45.000
J-Jennifer?!

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:47.300
Stop pretending to be her guardian.

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:50.010
You should be more honest like those kids earlier.

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:55.050
You'd better cherish the pressure of those breasts you feel on your back right now.

00:19:56.600 --> 00:20:00.520
Well, I have her beat in terms of size and shape.

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:10.020
What the heck am I doing...

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:12.530
Listen, you're part of the family now.

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:16.830
That means you can't make passes at anyone.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:18.330
Make passes?

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:23.540
Ah... it stopped raining.

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:31.630
You can use this room from tomorrow on.

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.010
Why don't you open the window?

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:36.590
Just do it. Come on.

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:41.810
<i>What is this thing anyway?</i>

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:21.720
That's where I used to live.

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:25.440
That's the lake I always looked at.

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:28.610
Below that is Takeru's lodging, the place we were just at.

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:30.400
We walked over that road.

00:21:31.190 --> 00:21:33.800
Beyond that is a town where lots of people live.

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:40.030
Hey, you should have a look too. We can see it so clearly.

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:42.080
Hey, when did you...?

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:50.000
It took off.

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:51.320
It's okay.

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:55.300
I'm sure he prefers the wide world too.

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:00.460
Yeah. The world is wide!

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:30.040
The sun aims straight at us.

00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:35.090
I want a tan from the bright summer light.

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:43.220
I wonder in what way today is going to change me.

00:22:43.220 --> 00:22:47.590
Despite some worries, it'll still be great.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:54.810
A part of summer bursts, jumps, and boils,.

00:22:55.110 --> 00:23:00.770
hitting the sky, ocean, and world.

00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:02.500
Hold me.

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:08.730
What will you do when I whisper those words to you?

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:13.440
I don't want precarious affection.

00:23:15.210 --> 00:23:21.480
Since a hunch can become truth in an instant,.

00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:25.230
in this hot season.

00:23:42.110 --> 00:23:42.910
It's Akari.

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:46.030
Next time on This Ugly and Beautiful World,.

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:47.330
"School Days."

00:23:48.450 --> 00:23:50.410
Eh, am I supposed to say something?

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:54.330
Um... my big sister is going to school for the first time.

00:23:54.580 --> 00:23:58.960
And then... um... a guy who looks like Kuon's big brother...

00:24:00.050 --> 00:24:01.590
...or is it his little brother?...

00:24:01.840 --> 00:24:07.390
...I'm not sure which but he appeared, and said, "You're small."

00:24:07.510 --> 00:24:09.470
And then, Kuon got mad and...
